00:35:16.706 --> 00:35:18.980
So, I think that
the technologists

00:35:18.981 --> 00:35:20.180
have an important role to

00:35:20.181 --> 00:35:24.120
play in helping to
steer away from that.

00:35:24.121 --> 00:35:27.160
Also, I think that
technologists sort of

00:35:27.161 --> 00:35:31.550
hearing more about
the concerns and the issues,

00:35:32.820 --> 00:35:35.650
they have some of
the tools needed to try to

00:35:35.651 --> 00:35:38.375
move those and act
on those concerns.

00:35:38.376 --> 00:35:39.900
So, we are sort of,

00:35:39.901 --> 00:35:40.960
but not by ourselves.

00:35:40.961 --> 00:35:44.710
Yes?

00:35:44.711 --> 00:35:49.230
&gt;&gt; How do we know that
