a universal Turing machine,

00:36:20.521 --> 00:36:22.855
and it got eschewed
any art training machine,

00:36:22.856 --> 00:36:26.520
the Nell computer will
also can map from

00:36:26.521 --> 00:36:27.635
a universal Turing machine

00:36:27.636 --> 00:36:31.520
to a metric, computable metric.

00:36:32.670 --> 00:36:37.070
&gt;&gt; So, I'm not sure what

