was appropriate to wait,

01:13:39.126 --> 01:13:42.245
that's a nonstarter in
the business world.

01:13:42.246 --> 01:13:44.360
Facebook is not going to stop.

01:13:44.361 --> 01:13:50.325
You just cannot stop industry
