01:15:09.410 --> 01:15:16.790
Yes, okay. Because
monitoring, you can do.

01:15:20.170 --> 01:15:21.410
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

01:15:21.411 --> 01:15:22.680
&gt;&gt; So, if you just do what

01:15:22.681 --> 01:15:24.430
people are doing and
