01:16:04.836 --> 01:16:06.460
&gt;&gt; But it seems like,
that's an issue

01:16:06.461 --> 01:16:09.140
where it's not as accurate
as he would like.

01:16:09.141 --> 01:16:12.210
So, the question is-

01:16:12.211 --> 01:16:14.370
&gt;&gt; It is certainly
an unfair impact-

01:16:14.371 --> 01:16:15.660
&gt;&gt; Inaccurate. Then okay,

01:16:15.661 --> 01:16:17.685
that's probably like
you'd like to fit,

01:16:17.686 --> 01:16:20.300
but the people making
that app would

01:16:20.301 --> 01:16:20.845
like to be more

01:16:20.846 --> 01:16:22.965
accurate and that's what
they're trying to do.

01:16:22.966 --> 01:16:24.665
&gt;&gt; No. No, I don't understand.

01:16:24.666 --> 01:16:28.475
If the app isn't being brought
over the right potholes,

01:16:28.476 --> 01:16:32.675
if it's not make penetrating
