01:16:32.676 --> 01:16:34.940
it's just not giving you
the information you want.

01:16:34.941 --> 01:16:37.225
The system as a whole is unfair.

01:16:37.226 --> 01:16:41.185
So, you're saying, is there
a classification algorithm?

01:16:41.186 --> 01:16:44.270
&gt;&gt; Lucy, that's like
the minority group,

01:16:44.271 --> 01:16:47.790
in which it has less data
