01:16:47.791 --> 01:16:49.775
Is roughly-

01:16:49.776 --> 01:16:55.025
&gt;&gt; It had, I mean,

01:16:55.026 --> 01:16:58.155
I'm not sure that it was
inaccurate where it was,

01:16:58.156 --> 01:16:59.845
it just wasn't coverage.

01:16:59.846 --> 01:17:02.255
There was lack of coverage.

01:17:02.256 --> 01:17:04.475
&gt;&gt; Maybe you don't
understand because like-

01:17:04.476 --> 01:17:07.550
&gt;&gt; Okay. Do you want to go
ahead and provide an example?

01:17:07.551 --> 01:17:09.210
&gt;&gt; Yes. So compass,

01:17:09.211 --> 01:17:10.900
so if you define -

01:17:10.901 --> 01:17:13.825
&gt;&gt; Wait, so you're going
to start with compass.

01:17:13.826 --> 01:17:19.385
The problem with compass is
that they were test fair.

01:17:19.386 --> 01:17:21.510
&gt;&gt; Right, for those criteria
but they weren't

01:17:21.511 --> 01:17:26.155
for- or positive and false
positive, false negative.

01:17:26.156 --> 01:17:29.880
&gt;&gt; Yes. But they were test
fair and it's impossible to

01:17:29.881 --> 01:17:32.300
