test fair and have

01:17:32.301 --> 01:17:34.010
equal false positive rates
and have equal

01:17:34.011 --> 01:17:36.575
false negative rates. So-

01:17:36.576 --> 01:17:39.975
&gt;&gt; I'm looking for one
where it's clear that it's

01:17:39.976 --> 01:17:44.510
unfair by if you talk to
a random person on the street,

01:17:44.511 --> 01:17:45.905
comes very clearly unfair.

01:17:45.906 --> 01:17:47.390
&gt;&gt; So-

01:17:47.391 --> 01:17:48.890
&gt;&gt; College admissions?

01:17:48.891 --> 01:17:49.265
&gt;&gt; Huh?

01:17:49.266 --> 01:17:51.350
&gt;&gt; College admissions and wealth

01:17:51.351 --> 01:17:53.985
is probably
a really good example.

01:17:53.986 --> 01:17:58.900
&gt;&gt; So affirmative action
is controversial, right?

01:17:58.901 --> 01:18:01.020
&gt;&gt; This is part of the issue.

01:18:01.021 --> 01:18:02.700
When I began the talk by

01:18:02.701 --> 01:18:05.020
