01:18:08.276 --> 01:18:11.465
So is affirmative action fair?

01:18:11.466 --> 01:18:13.065
What do you think?

01:18:13.066 --> 01:18:15.060
There will be a range of

01:18:15.061 --> 01:18:18.590
