algorithms

01:18:27.441 --> 01:18:28.725
that were very biased?

01:18:28.726 --> 01:18:31.350
Yes. The answer is yes.

01:18:31.640 --> 01:18:36.860
&gt;&gt; When we talk about
fairness and classification,

01:18:36.861 --> 01:18:40.190
it seems like some
