all the usual situation,

01:19:50.431 --> 01:19:51.770
it'll be more accurate.

01:19:51.771 --> 01:19:54.040
In the really wacky ones,

01:19:54.041 --> 01:19:56.375
it'll be no worse than humans.

01:19:56.376 --> 01:19:59.045
So altogether, it's better.

01:19:59.046 --> 01:20:03.200
&gt;&gt; And you say, oh what
