01:20:03.201 --> 01:20:06.290
what does that really mean?

01:20:06.291 --> 01:20:09.645
I mean, I think one way,

01:20:09.646 --> 01:20:11.775
one intuition is that everyone is

01:20:11.776 --> 01:20:13.710
equal so there's no way-.

01:20:13.711 --> 01:20:14.965
&gt;&gt; So what a random
person would do.

01:20:14.966 --> 01:20:17.640
So with some probability
distribution and you just

01:20:17.641 --> 01:20:18.900
draw from that distribution

01:20:18.901 --> 01:20:21.300
